    "id": "fujiang:exchange-ad:adcs-esc1-esc8",
    "category": "exchange-ad",
    "source_ref": "plugin/knowledge/exchange-ad/adcs-esc1-esc8.md",
    "metadata": {
      "title": "AD CS 证书滥用（ESC1 / ESC8 等）",
      "cve": "无单一 CVE（Certified Pre-Owned）",
      "severity": "critical",
      "source_cvss": "8.8",
      "product": "Active Directory Certificate Services",
      "versions": "任意 AD CS 部署（配置缺陷）",
      "ports": "80, 443, 135, 445",
      "keywords": "adcs, esc1, esc8, certipy, pki, certificate-template",
      "verified": "false",
      "sources": "公开资料整理（业务逻辑 / 实现 / 配置缺陷类，无 CVE；出处见文末参考）"
    },
    "metadata_origin": "uploaded-archive-frontmatter",
    "source_sections": {
      "fingerprint": true,
      "preconditions": true,
      "remediation": true,
      "references": true
    },
    "remediation_source": "- 模板去掉 `CT_FLAG_ENROLLEE_SUPPLIES_SUBJECT`；限制谁可注册/写模板 ACL；CA 开启 EPA + 关闭 NTLM 的 Web Enrollment。\n- 检测：`certipy` 类工具会在 CA 上留下 4886/4887 事件与异常 `Request ID`。",
    "reference_notes": "- SpecterOps《Certified Pre-Owned》；certipy 文档。",
    "mirror_url": "https://github.com/sanjiu2024/dsh-team-workflow/blob/c55070e2858c1677bbebaf6ec1e8f13dad366cd6/skills/kb-exchange-ad/adcs-esc1-esc8.md"
