      "fingerprint": true,
      "preconditions": true,
      "remediation": true,
      "references": true
    },
    "remediation_source": "- 打 MS17-010（KB4013389 等）；关闭 SMBv1（`Disable-WindowsOptionalFeature -Online -FeatureName smb1protocol`）。\n- 检测：445 上异常的 SMB `Trans2` 大包、`lsass` 异常访问。",
