    "category": "exchange-ad",
    "source_ref": "plugin/knowledge/exchange-ad/cve-2021-34527-printnightmare.md",
    "metadata": {
      "title": "PrintNightmare（打印后台服务任意 DLL 加载）",
      "cve": "CVE-2021-34527",
      "severity": "critical",
      "source_cvss": "8.8",
      "product": "Windows Print Spooler",
      "versions": "全版本（2021-07 补丁前；远程变体需 445 + 打印服务）",
      "ports": "445, 135",
      "keywords": "printnightmare, spooler, rpcaddprinterdriverex, dll, cve-2021-34527",
      "verified": "false",
      "sources": "NVD / 厂商公告 / 公开分析（见文末参考）"
    },
    "metadata_origin": "uploaded-archive-frontmatter",
    "source_sections": {
      "fingerprint": true,
      "preconditions": true,
      "remediation": true,
      "references": true
    },
    "remediation_source": "- 打 2021-07 补丁；设 `RestrictDriverInstallationToAdministrators=1`；禁用 Print Spooler（`Stop-Service Spooler; Set-Service Spooler -StartupType Disabled`）在 DC 上尤其必须。\n- 检测：事件 316/808（PrintService）、`spoolsv.exe` 加载非系统 DLL。",
    "reference_notes": "- NVD CVE-2021-34527；MSRC 2021-07；cube0x0 的 PoC。",
    "mirror_url": "https://github.com/sanjiu2024/dsh-team-workflow/blob/c55070e2858c1677bbebaf6ec1e8f13dad366cd6/skills/kb-exchange-ad/cve-2021-34527-printnightmare.md"
  },
